---
// The fifth audience (founder 2026-08-10): plants, animals and places who
// need stewards but are equal participants in the economy — not just
// people. Huachuma (San Pedro cactus) has healed trauma and restored
// spiritual connection for centuries; unconscious harvesting driven by
// demand, with zero accountability, now puts the species at risk. Huachuma
// holds a member profile of her own on Lichen (Figma Lichen Pitch
// Collateral, node 700:1612) — the same multi-species-membership pattern
// as Tango — and the value she creates flows back to her own protection.
import PhoneFrame from './PhoneFrame.astro';
import AppIcon from './AppIcon.astro';
import ScenePair from './ScenePair.astro';
const PLANTS = '#98BE4D';
---
<ScenePair eyebrow="Equal participants · Huachuma the healing plant">
  <svg slot="map" viewBox="0 0 340 250" role="img"
    aria-label="A map route: Huachuma, a healing plant put at risk by unconscious over-harvesting; those she heals, their contributions tracked in her name through the Universal Current-cy; the Huachuma Foundation, her recognized steward; planting projects in Peru, guided by the plant's original indigenous stewards.">
    <path d="M-10,108 q45,-12 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.5" />
    <path d="M-10,178 q45,10 90,0 t90,0 t90,0 t90,0" fill="none" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="0.9" opacity="0.4" />
    <path d="M44,48 C92,20 148,36 200,64 C226,88 152,112 110,140 C78,162 190,168 256,204"
      fill="none" stroke={PLANTS} stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 6" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <circle cx="44" cy="48" r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke={PLANTS} stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="44" y="53" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">🌵</text>
    <text x="46" y="82" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="middle">Huachuma</text>
    <text x="46" y="94" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="middle">at risk from over-harvesting</text>
    <circle cx="200" cy="64" r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke="var(--bone-edge)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="200" y="69" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">🙏</text>
    <text x="222" y="60" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="start">those she heals</text>
    <text x="222" y="72" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="start">value tracked in her name</text>
    <circle cx="110" cy="140" r="16" fill="var(--peach-tint)" stroke="var(--peach)" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="110" y="145" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">🌱</text>
    <text x="88" y="130" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="end">Huachuma</text>
    <text x="88" y="142" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="end">Foundation</text>
    <text x="88" y="154" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="end">her recognized steward</text>
    <circle cx="256" cy="204" r="16" fill="var(--bone-warm)" stroke={PLANTS} stroke-width="1.2" />
    <text x="256" y="209" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle">⛰️</text>
    <text x="250" y="232" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)" text-anchor="middle">planting, in Peru</text>
    <text x="250" y="244" font-size="9" font-style="italic" fill="var(--ink-soft)" text-anchor="middle">led by her indigenous stewards</text>
  </svg>

  <PhoneFrame slot="phone" initial="H" active="home" mark={false}>
    <div class="hua">
      <div class="hua-head">
        <span class="hua-ava"><AppIcon name="leaf" size={16} /></span>
        <div>
          <p class="hua-name">Huachuma Foundation</p>
          <p class="hua-sub">Community</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hua-card">
        <p class="hua-card-h">Huachuma Wisdom</p>
        <p class="hua-card-body">Join us for an immersive 6-month exploration into the profound world of Huachuma — a blend of historical, scientific, spiritual and practical knowledge, guiding participants.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hua-card">
        <p class="hua-card-h">Huachuma Planting Party <em>(in Peru!)</em></p>
        <p class="hua-card-body">Dates are set for our annual planting. Huachuma has enough reserves to offer limited scholarship spots for those who cannot afford air fare.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hua-cy">
        <span class="hua-cy-label">Current-cy attributed to Huachuma</span>
        <span class="hua-cy-amt"><svg class="hua-bolt" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13.5 3 6 13.5h4.8L10.5 21 18 10.5h-4.8L13.5 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>2,140</span>
        <span class="hua-cy-note">funding this quarter&rsquo;s planting</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hua-foot">We don&rsquo;t give Huachuma a seat at the table. We benefit from having it there.</p>
    </div>
  </PhoneFrame>

  <Fragment slot="capmap">
    San Pedro cactus has been used for centuries to heal trauma, restore spiritual
    connection, and re-balance our relationship with the earth. Unconscious harvesting,
    driven by growing demand and zero accountability, is putting the species at risk — a
    plant that heals disconnection, being destroyed by it.
  </Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="capphone">
    Huachuma holds a member profile of her own. As individuals, organizations and
    communities work with the plant medicine, the value of that healing is tracked and
    attributed back to her through the Universal Current-cy — funding education,
    practitioner training and on-the-ground planting, guided by the plant&rsquo;s original
    indigenous stewards. The more she heals, the more flows back to protect her.
  </Fragment>
</ScenePair>

<style>
  .hua { padding: 10px 12px 12px; }
  .hua-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .hua-ava {
    width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--bone-warm); border: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); color: var(--peach-deep);
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .hua-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .hua-sub { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 1px; }
  .hua-card {
    margin-top: 9px; background: var(--bone-warm); border: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 9px 11px;
  }
  .hua-card-h { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .hua-card-h em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .hua-card-body { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 3px; }
  .hua-cy {
    margin-top: 9px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 1px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #98BE4D 12%, transparent); border: 1px solid #98BE4D; border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 9px 10px;
  }
  .hua-cy-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .hua-cy-amt { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; color: var(--peach-deep); margin-top: 2px; }
  .hua-bolt { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  .hua-cy-note { font-size: 8.5px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: 1px; }
  .hua-foot { text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: 10px; }
</style>
